# TU8, TU9: e_ach makes an array of its results, and a tuple is no
# array item; m_ap boxes each result instead.
== SOURCE
'{ x -> (x, x) } e_ach 1 2 3
== ERROR
error[type-mismatch]: expected an array, found a tuple
 --> -e:1:1
  |
1 | '{ x -> (x, x) } e_ach 1 2 3
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  = note: `e_ach` has type (a -> b) -> a -> b
